40:51Z"},{"number":223,"title":"有一点点耗token","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-02T14:27:50Z"},{"number":204,"title":"建议：新增 Shizuku 作为获取内置助手的第二条路（可选，默认仍走无线调试）","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-02T10:24:19Z"},{"number":533,"title":"接入微信无法进行搜索","comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:01Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"Mika v0.1.42","tag":"v0.1.42","published_at":"2026-11-13T18:16:23Z","body":"## 0.1.42\n\n### 兼容性\n- 最低支持版本降到 Android 10（minSdk 30 → 29），Android 10 / 11 也能安装运行。\n\n### 修复\n- 锁屏解锁后任务不再卡在「等你解锁手机」，改用 `isDeviceLocked` 判定（#590）。\n- 试用技能不再一次失败就停用，Token 预算用完不算技能失败（#569）。\n- ADB 连接失败时如实上报，不再返回空的设备。\n\n### 新功能\n- 定时任务通知支持免打扰时段。\n- 支持复制定时计划。\n- 文件库支持按类型筛选。\n- 侧栏「个人助手」入口跟随开关显隐。\n\n### 实验功能（默认关闭）\n- 主动能力：读选定 App 的通知并静默判定，胶囊角标提示值得提醒的，逐步归纳话题与联系人。入口在「设置 › 高级 › 开发者选项」。\n\n### 其它\n- 修复多个真机测试，让设备测试套件恢复全绿。\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"AI requests expand beyond conversation: Mika's screen handover and DeepSeek's prototype intake rules","url":"https://note.com/simizu_note_ai/n/nbf09b1689e83?hl=en","source":"note","lang":"en","date":"2026-10-31"},{"title":"手机里藏了个隐形助手，干活时你照样刷微信|Mika|王赞|安卓|Agent_新浪新闻","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE5ueFpfRDFpQnJhQUw1dl9nZlBqTEJhNGFxa1VqQ1dsc1FMcTh6N0ZsNnVMdnkzVUxNWTA2Y2xPS0ZTUU5vSjZaaG5XdVgxUkgwOXNMb1Vxek1fU3FtV0liQnhCWQ?oc=5","source":"新浪网","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-31"},{"title":"UC San Diego Team Launches Free ‘Digital Twin’ for End-to-End Testing of Applications over Wireless","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNeXltS2JNYU5CM1pYaXFIUUZ2ZWpvZTRJWWQtYVRWZkVTanlkSml1TS1LSWlKc1Y4bzFzSkZhUzRCV0dlR2o3VzJFWGNJT1Rvakd3eXlRZnNMQjVVbXhCZURPTXNwQ2JPcXpBREp2Q0FkM2N2Yms5SzBXRDdHbkRDazc3dEJyU1o4Skw5bmF2Y3VsZFFmUU04OXBfdWQxblZpVHZ5SUdJNm1CVjhIbUFRRHgzS21tbUxjLUlXLVRMNk93YnM4?oc=5","source":"UC San Diego Today","lang":"en","date":"2026-05-11"},{"title":"Copilot .Net modernization tool a 'huge downgrade,' devs say – and no longer free","url